        "richTextValue" : "<div style=\"\n    width: 1440px;\n    padding-top: 15px;\n    padding-bottom: 15px;\n    padding-right: 40px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n\">\n\n    <h1 style=\"\n               width:100%;\n        margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n        font-size: 28px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        color: #1f1f1f;\n        line-height: 1.2;\n    \">\n Health Authority Contacts\n    </h1>\n\n    <div style=\"\n        width:1255px;  \n        box-sizing:border-box;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        color: #222222;\n    \">\n     Use this page to find contact information for your Health Authority. If you are unsure which Health Authority you belong to, refer to the <a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/health/about-bc-s-health-care-system/partners/health-authorities/regional-health-authorities\" style=\"color:#0070d2; text-decoration:underline;\"> Province of British Columbia website</a>, where you can search by community name or use the regional map to locate your Health Authority.\n    </div>\n\n</div>"
